+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0821","lang":"zh","lemma":"配送","display_form":"配送","pos":"verb","rank":821,"pronunciation":"pèisòng"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"to deliver","secondary_glosses":["to dispatch"],"notes":"Usually used for delivering goods or supplies to a home, shop, or other destination."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0821-ex1","meaning_en":"to deliver","sentence":"公司说今天下午会把电脑配送到家。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0821-ex2","meaning_en":"to deliver","sentence":"搬新家那天，我们让公司直接配送床和桌子。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0821-ex3","meaning_en":"to deliver","sentence":"爷爷住院以后，药店每天都会配送药过去。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0821-ex1","translation":"The company said it would deliver the computer to my home this afternoon."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0821-ex2","translation":"On the day we moved, we had the company deliver the bed and table directly."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0821-ex3","translation":"After Grandpa was hospitalized, the pharmacy delivered medicine to the hospital every day."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0822","lang":"zh","lemma":"盆","display_form":"盆","pos":"noun","rank":822,"pronunciation":"pén"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"basin; pot","secondary_glosses":["tub"],"notes":"Noun for an open container used for water, washing, plants, or other things placed inside."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0822-ex1","meaning_en":"basin","sentence":"洗完菜以后，她把水倒进旁边的大盆里。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0822-ex2","meaning_en":"pot","sentence":"阳台上那盆花几天没浇水，叶子都软了。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0822-ex3","meaning_en":"basin","sentence":"医生让他先把脚放进那盆热水里。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0822-ex1","translation":"After washing the vegetables, she poured the water into the big basin beside her."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0822-ex2","translation":"That potted flower on the balcony hasn't been watered for days, and all its leaves have gone limp."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0822-ex3","translation":"The doctor told him to put his feet into that basin of hot water first."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0823","lang":"zh","lemma":"碰","display_form":"碰","pos":"verb","rank":823,"pronunciation":"pèng"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"to bump into","secondary_glosses":["to touch"],"notes":"Usually means to hit or touch something, often by accident. In warnings, it can simply mean not to touch."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0823-ex1","meaning_en":"to bump into","sentence":"他下楼的时候，碰到了门口的椅子。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0823-ex2","meaning_en":"to touch","sentence":"这个杯子太薄，你轻轻一碰就会碎。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0823-ex3","meaning_en":"to touch","sentence":"你先别碰那个杯子，水还很热。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0823-ex1","translation":"While going downstairs, he bumped into the chair by the doorway."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0823-ex2","translation":"This cup is so thin that it will shatter if you touch it lightly."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0823-ex3","translation":"Don't touch that cup yet; the water is still very hot."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0824","lang":"zh","lemma":"碰见","display_form":"碰见","pos":"verb","rank":824,"pronunciation":"pèngjiàn"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"to run into","secondary_glosses":["to meet by chance"],"notes":"Verb for unexpectedly meeting someone in ordinary daily situations."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0824-ex1","meaning_en":"to run into","sentence":"我刚出地铁站，就碰见了以前的老师。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0824-ex2","meaning_en":"to run into","sentence":"她在路上碰见妈妈，才知道家里来客人了。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0824-ex3","meaning_en":"to meet by chance","sentence":"我们只想买面包，却碰见了正在找我们的朋友。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0824-ex1","translation":"I had just come out of the subway station when I ran into one of my former teachers."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0824-ex2","translation":"She ran into her mother on the way and only then learned that guests had come to the house."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0824-ex3","translation":"We only wanted to buy bread, but we ran into the friend who was looking for us."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0825","lang":"zh","lemma":"批","display_form":"批","pos":"measure word","rank":825,"pronunciation":"pī"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"batch; lot","secondary_glosses":["shipment","group"],"notes":"Measure word for people, goods, or items dealt with in the same group or shipment."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0825-ex1","meaning_en":"batch","sentence":"这批苹果今天早上刚从南方运到市场。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0825-ex2","meaning_en":"group","sentence":"第一批游客已经上车了，大家再等十分钟。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0825-ex3","meaning_en":"batch","sentence":"老师说那批桌子明天上午送到学校。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0825-ex1","translation":"This batch of apples was just shipped to the market from the south this morning."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0825-ex2","translation":"The first group of tourists has already boarded the bus; everyone else wait another ten minutes."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0825-ex3","translation":"The teacher said that batch of desks would be delivered to the school tomorrow morning."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0826","lang":"zh","lemma":"批","display_form":"批","pos":"verb","rank":826,"pronunciation":"pī"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"to criticize","secondary_glosses":["to mark","to approve"],"notes":"Commonly means to criticize or scold. In school contexts it can mean to mark written work, and in formal contexts it can mean to approve."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0826-ex1","meaning_en":"to criticize","sentence":"因为我又迟到了，经理开会时当面批了我。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0826-ex2","meaning_en":"to mark","sentence":"老师把我们的作业都批了。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0826-ex3","meaning_en":"to approve","sentence":"领导已经把这个计划批了，我们明天就做。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0826-ex1","translation":"Because I was late again, the manager criticized me to my face during the meeting."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0826-ex2","translation":"The teacher marked all of our homework."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0826-ex3","translation":"The leadership has already approved this plan, so we'll start on it tomorrow."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0827","lang":"zh","lemma":"批准","display_form":"批准","pos":"verb","rank":827,"pronunciation":"pīzhǔn"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"to approve","secondary_glosses":["to authorize"],"notes":"Formal verb for giving official permission or agreeing to a plan, request, or decision."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0827-ex1","meaning_en":"to approve","sentence":"经理批准了我的假，我下周可以回家。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0827-ex2","meaning_en":"to approve","sentence":"这个项目昨天终于被学校批准了。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0827-ex3","meaning_en":"to authorize","sentence":"没有家长批准，孩子不能自己报名。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0827-ex1","translation":"The manager approved my leave, so I can go home next week."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0827-ex2","translation":"This project was finally approved by the school yesterday."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0827-ex3","translation":"Without a parent's approval, a child can't sign up alone."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0828","lang":"zh","lemma":"匹","display_form":"匹","pos":"measure word","rank":828,"pronunciation":"pǐ"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"measure word for horses; bolt of cloth","secondary_glosses":["bolt (of cloth)"],"notes":"Measure word used mainly for horses and similar animals, and also for whole lengths of cloth."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0828-ex1","meaning_en":"measure word for horses","sentence":"那匹老马看见主人来了，就慢慢走过来。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0828-ex2","meaning_en":"bolt (of cloth)","sentence":"奶奶买了一匹蓝布，准备给我做裤子。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0828-ex3","meaning_en":"measure word for horses","sentence":"草地上那匹白马慢慢走到河边去了。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0828-ex1","translation":"When the old horse saw its owner coming, it slowly walked over."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0828-ex2","translation":"Grandma bought a bolt of blue cloth and plans to make pants for me."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0828-ex3","translation":"The white horse on the grass slowly walked to the riverbank."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0829","lang":"zh","lemma":"骗","display_form":"骗","pos":"verb","rank":829,"pronunciation":"piàn"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"to cheat; to deceive","secondary_glosses":["to trick","to lie to"],"notes":"Can mean cheating someone out of something or misleading someone with a lie."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0829-ex1","meaning_en":"to trick","sentence":"那个人假装是医生，差点骗走了老人的钱。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0829-ex2","meaning_en":"to deceive","sentence":"你别再骗孩子说打针一点儿也不疼。","difficulty":2,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0829-ex3","meaning_en":"to lie to","sentence":"他怕妈妈生气，就骗她说作业写完了。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0829-ex1","translation":"That person pretended to be a doctor and almost tricked the old man out of his money."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0829-ex2","translation":"Stop telling the child that shots don't hurt at all."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0829-ex3","translation":"He was afraid his mother would get angry, so he lied to her and said the homework was finished."}]}
+{"word":{"id":"new-hsk-5-0830","lang":"zh","lemma":"拼","display_form":"拼","pos":"verb","rank":830,"pronunciation":"pīn"},"glosses":{"primary_gloss":"to put together","secondary_glosses":["to spell","to give it one's all"],"notes":"Can mean joining things together, spelling a word, or pushing oneself hard to win or finish something."},"examples":[{"id":"new-hsk-5-0830-ex1","meaning_en":"to put together","sentence":"请把这两张小桌子拼在一起，大家才坐得下。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":true},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0830-ex2","meaning_en":"to spell","sentence":"报名时我把自己的姓拼错了，只好重新填表。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false},{"id":"new-hsk-5-0830-ex3","meaning_en":"to give it one's all","sentence":"比赛只剩最后一分钟，大家决定再拼一次。","difficulty":3,"source":"generator-3","is_primary":false}],"example_translations":[{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0830-ex1","translation":"Please push these two small tables together so everyone can fit."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0830-ex2","translation":"When signing up, I spelled my own surname wrong, so I had to fill out the form again."},{"example_id":"new-hsk-5-0830-ex3","translation":"With only the last minute left in the game, everyone decided to make one more all-out effort."}]}

